  "version": 1,
  "about": "KN-1 derived setup criteria (pilot). One entry per UCT setup template: named conditions mapped to measurable ids from the closed list in docs/agent/program/contracts/KN-1-knowledge.md, so an Agent capability can test each one against served bars/indicators and report evidence vs interpretation. DERIVED from the Brain Pack's setup_templates (not the partner's pipeline). RULES: `value` only when the number (or the plain meaning of above/below) is literally in the template field named by `locator`; otherwise null. basis 'stated' = comparison and value are literal; 'interpreted' = a window, unit or mapping was chosen by us (listed in `assumptions`). `strength` = required | preferred, as the template words it. NOTHING here is served until an entry is reviewed: setup.playbook adds `criteria` only for entries with reviewed: true.",
